jobs.description:
The RPH department is responsible for receiving, checking, storing and processing parts for ASML. These parts are used in high-tech machines and must be handled carefully and accurately.

Because the department covers different logistics processes, there are several opportunities available. Depending on your experience and interests, your tasks may include:

- Receiving and checking incoming goods;
- Scanning and registering products in the system;
- Picking orders;
- Moving materials within the warehouse;
- Performing stock checks;
- Packing and preparing shipments;
- Working according to quality and safety procedures.

Whether you already have warehouse experience or are looking for a new challenge, there are different roles available within the RPH department.

- Good communication skills in English;
- Availability to work full-time;
- A motivated and responsible attitude;
- Attention to detail and quality;
- Warehouse experience is a plus, but not required.
